#: filter-guard-for-woocommerce.php:1014
msgid "Apache/LiteSpeed .htaccess rules run before WordPress. Requests blocked by those pre-PHP rules are intentionally not recorded in the WordPress database event log. The Live Dashboard counters below count PHP-level plugin events only."
