msgid "Direct visits from Google, external links, messaging apps, or browsers that omit the Referer header may receive 403 on protected filtered URLs until a valid Filter Guard cookie and internal referer exist. Use this mode mainly during active crawl floods; Cookie or SEO Soft is usually safer for normal operation."
